# Review

Score the work using the `quality-sentinel` skill.

## Skill Loaded
**Required:** Read `skills/quality-sentinel/SKILL.md` and `commands/review.md`, plus
`contexts/review.md`.

## Usage
```
/review
/review src/api/donations.ts
```

## Output
Verdict, Score, Blocking, Suggestions, Deliberately skipped.

## Notes
Zero findings is a valid result. A reviewer that always finds something teaches its
readers to stop reading.
